Flow Enter Jack Hunt
Id jack-hunt.enter

Screen Splash
Id jack-hunt.splash

When the user becomes signed in

  Action Enter conversation
  Id conversation.enter

    Receives
      Signed-in user

    Steps
      Go to jack-hunt.conversation
      Hide the splash screen

      At the same time
        Load the cart
        Register the device for notifications
        Get or create a shopping session

      Once the shopping session is ready
        Go to conversation.bootstrap

      If getting the shopping session fails
        Show a conversation error with retry

    Outcome
      Conversation screen is open

Screen Conversation
Id jack-hunt.conversation

Action Bootstrap conversation
Id conversation.bootstrap

  Steps
    Prepare the initial conversation

  Outcome
    Conversation is ready
